{"v":4,"desc":"打掉它們的絨毛！\n\n製造出世界上最好的泰迪熊的玩具工廠已經瘋了。\n\n所有的泰迪熊都逃走了，變成了邪惡，你是唯一可以阻止它們接管世界的人。\n\nTeddy gangs 是一款有趣、快速的格鬥遊戲，你必須打敗任何敢於挑戰你的泰迪熊，所以準備好對抗成群的邪惡泰迪熊，但要注意這不會是毛茸茸的事情。","publisher":"Sabec","release":"2021-09-09","genres":["街機","格鬥"],"players":"單機 1–2 人","langs":["英文"],"pmax":2,"poff":2,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.3GB / Switch 0.3GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/3901290c57ed6f32ad0c728a6949e197ce0df2bd0a73739cde16b2bee6aabcd2.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/9f85c4a49be3ce2ffb6f8c049d9522a1c3683972c451735629e93b36b2e4e0a8.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/4b10ef3c7eaf2bb3d58ac50899e674dfaee3c8efafa3719a640868332a8632ed.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/1345ed7bb5d249de4c7eb3ea118a9c869dce53f024a659d535ea2ec2bea045a6.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/1e86b0ddeb026ca88d7d05fd3b95d62467eb1ec21215042449a09cdf7192b62a.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/d49eded05f8637cc8ea7dddef4ca28a5ba6c86d1dbdb9939f7091119f0d35c41.jpg"],"titleId":"0100fae00f728000","dlc":[]}